# Vekrom: Caddy na frente de tudo (HTTPS automático).
# Troque o domínio abaixo quando tiver domínio próprio e rode: sudo systemctl reload caddy
144-33-6-56.sslip.io {
	encode zstd gzip

	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
		X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
		Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
		X-Frame-Options "DENY"
		Permissions-Policy "camera=(self), microphone=(self), display-capture=(self), geolocation=(), payment=()"
		Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' wss://{host}; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'"
		-Server
	}

	# Uploads direto do disco: nomes aleatórios (uuid), conteúdo imutável -> cache de 1 ano.
	# sandbox impede que um arquivo rode script mesmo se for aberto direto.
	handle_path /api/files/* {
		root * /home/vekrom/uploads
		@valid path_regexp ^/[0-9a-f-]{36}\.(png|jpg|gif|webp|wav|ogg|flac|mp3|m4a|mp4)$
		handle @valid {
			header Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
			header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'none'; sandbox"
			file_server
		}
		respond 404
	}

	handle_path /api/* {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:3001
	}

	handle /ws* {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:3002
	}

	# Assets com hash no nome: cache longo. index.html: sempre revalida.
	handle /assets/* {
		root * /home/vekrom/vekrom/apps/web/dist
		header Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
		file_server
	}

	handle {
		root * /home/vekrom/vekrom/apps/web/dist
		try_files {path} /index.html
		header Cache-Control "no-cache"
		file_server
	}
}
